WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:15.716
My friend Billy is coming.

2
00:00:15.717 --> 00:00:20.752
I hear his footsteps.

3
00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:25.668
Billy likes strawberry ice cream.

4
00:00:25.669 --> 00:00:30.017
I smell his ice cream.

5
00:00:30.018 --> 00:00:37.289
I see Billy.

6
00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:41.096
Billy touches my head.

7
00:00:41.097 --> 00:00:46.603
I taste his ice cream.

8
00:00:46.604 --> 00:00:57.398
Billy is my best friend.
